{"q":"3822","t":"Design Order Management System","d":"Medium","p":true,"c":null,"h":["Keep track of orders by their <code>orderId</code> so you can quickly modify or cancel them.","Group active orders by <code>(orderType, price)</code> to efficiently answer queries.","When an order is modified or canceled, make sure all related data structures stay in sync."],"m":"{\n  \"classname\": \"OrderManagementSystem\",\n  \"constructor\": {\n    \"params\": []\n  },\n  \"methods\": [\n    {\n      \"params\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"orderId\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"name\": \"orderType\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"price\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"name\": \"addOrder\",\n      \"return\": {\n        \"type\": \"void\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"params\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"orderId\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"newPrice\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"name\": \"modifyOrder\",\n      \"return\": {\n        \"type\": \"void\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"params\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"orderId\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"name\": \"cancelOrder\",\n      \"return\": {\n        \"type\": \"void\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"params\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"name\": \"orderType\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"name\": \"price\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"name\": \"getOrdersAtPrice\",\n      \"return\": {\n        \"type\": \"integer[]\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n  },\n  \"systemdesign\": true\n}","g":[{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"Design","slug":"design"}]}